  "pages": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "body": "Each line below names one rule of a value written in text, then shows the value itself, so a reader can check the two agree.\n\n## Values read from the record\n\nA figure by its name: {{open-tasks}} tasks are open.\n\nHow far that figure moved: {{open-tasks.change}}.\n\nThe first task that figure counts: {{open-tasks.first}}.\n\nHow many tasks the record holds, a count and never the tasks themselves: {{tasks.count}}. How many of them are open: {{tasks.open}}.\n\nA field of one task, named by its list and number: {{tasks#1.what}}.\n\nA long field is never pulled into text, so the notes of that task show a dash: {{tasks#1.note}}.\n\nA name that points at nothing is shown as written, marked: {{no-such-figure}}.\n\nA value inside backticks is left exactly as typed: `{{open-tasks}}`.\n\n## Typed values\n\nA day ahead, with how far off it is: {{date:2030-12-24}}.\n\nA day behind, with no link: {{day:2020-04-10}}.\n\nThe time left to a day: {{until:2030-01-01}}. The time left to the first task's due day: {{until:tasks#1.by}}.\n\nThe time since a day: {{ago:2020-01-01}}.\n\nMoney in minor units with its currency: {{money:129900 EGP}}. Money below nought: {{money:-4200 GBP}}.\n\nA currency with four decimals: {{money:1000000 CLF}} and {{money:123456 UYW}}.\n\nA number with its unit: {{quantity:1.4 m}}. A quantity below nought: {{quantity:-2.5 kg}}. A whole number below nought: {{quantity:-1299}}.\n\nA percentage: {{pct:-46.3}}. A percentage written loosely stays as typed, marked: {{pct:12 %}}.\n\nA task named by reference: {{ref:tasks#1}}.\n\nA typed value that does not parse stays as typed, marked: {{money:12.50 GBP}} and {{date:2026-13-45}}.\n\n## Icons and evidence\n\nAn icon set inside a sentence: {{icon:rocket}} launched.\n\nChecked once against a source: {verified} and {verified: the bank statement}.\n\nWorked out from other facts: {inferred} and {inferred: two invoices}.\n\nA careful guess: {estimate} and {estimate: last quarter's pace}.\n\nNot known yet, something to find out: {unknown} and {unknown: nobody has asked}.",
          "document": true,
          "heading": "Values in text",
          "kind": "note",
          "span": 12,
          "key": "k0rajghh",
          "rows": [],
